TI  - DEVELOPMENT OF CROSS-POLARIZED COMPONENT OF DUBOIS MODEL FOR ENHANCED SOIL MOISTURE ESTIMATION USING DPRVI WITH DUAL-POLARIZED C-BAND SAR DATA
PY  - 2025
