TI  - SOIL FERTILITY ASSESSMENT AND MAPPING IN BARDARASH DISTRICT, DUHOK PROVINCE, IRAQ: AN INTEGRATED APPROACH USING GEOSTATISTICS, MACHINE LEARNING, AND LABORATORY ANALYSES
PY  - 2026
